OL,3,GNEWSAParliament date set for 'summer of
OL,4,Asex' debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamantha Niblett has previously said
OL,7,Fshe also planned a separate event to
OL,8,Fdisplay a number of sex toys and sex
OL,9,Feducation aids in Parliament as part of
OL,10,Fthe campaign. However, this is unlikely
OL,11,Fto take place until the new year.
OL,13,FThe backbench debate is due to take
OL,14,Fplace in Parliament on 26 November, it
OL,15,Fhas been confirmed.
